["amend","ARCHIMP-S19-T2",1784509932,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"definition_of_done":"AppendRawLines is removed and replaced by an AppendLog type in internal/adapters (not internal/ops) owning the .pending crash-recovery marker protocol. AppendLog is constructed fresh per call; production behavior only. Crash-simulation lives in a separate test helper, shared by files_test.go and the relocated replay test. Callers in internal/ops and internal/materialize/pipeline.go call AppendLog directly. See notes for full design."}]
["amend","ARCHIMP-S19-T3",1784509932,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"definition_of_done":"replay_test.go moves from internal/e2eharness to internal/materialize, package clause changed from e2eharness_test to materialize (white-box), matching the dominant convention there. Uses the shared torn-write fixture helper from ARCHIMP-S19-T2 instead of hand-rolled construction. No cross-referencing doc note added — out of scope. See notes for detail."}]
