["transition","ARCHIMP-S19",1784574578,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"to":"done","outcome":"Delivered 3 fixes to the TOPTIER-S3 recovery/replay hot spot: (T1) corrected stale DisallowUnknownFields comment in strictdecode_test.go; (T2) replaced adapters.AppendRawLines with an owned AppendLog type (NewAppendLog(path).Append(buf)) preserving the .pending crash-recovery protocol verbatim, plus a new exported SimulatePendingMarker test helper; (T3) relocated replay_test.go to internal/materialize as a white-box test using the shared helper. All merged into feat/ARCHIMP-S19. make check green (85.9% coverage, 100% mutation efficacy); arm validate 705/705 cited; auditor and fable code-review both signed off (one trivial comment-path fix applied per fable's finding)."}]
