["transition","TOPTIER-S5",1784893168,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"to":"done","outcome":"Delivered hook conformance test matrix (binding state x tool x path, 3 dogfood bypass cases), scope-violation pass-through logging + D8 doctor check wired into arm doctor, and threat-model documentation cross-linked from sensitive-environments.md. Two rounds of per-task conformance review found and fixed real gaps (missing contract-named tests, unimplemented pass-through logging, dead D8 wiring). Auditor pre-merge gate passed. Holistic opus code-review found and fixed 7 further issues (D8 walking all committed files instead of git-status-scoped untracked/modified paths, missing stale-binding conformance coverage, log-injection sanitization gap, doc inconsistencies, weak test assertions). PR #87 opened against main."}]
