["create","LNGHZN-S10",1786748962,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Gate efficiency story","type":"story","acceptance":["All child tasks merged and confirmed on main","Cumulative full gate green at story integration head","arm validate exits 0 (strict) at story close"],"definition_of_done":"All ratified decisions in docs/design/gate-efficiency.md (D1-D8) are delivered: two-tier gates are normative, check-fast exists with deterministic routing, gate evidence is recorded and consumed in review, validate is strict by default and enforced at plan release, and vertical-slice coupling is detected at planning time.","priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
["create","LNGHZN-S10-T1",1786748962,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Make two-tier gate workflow, bounded review, and effort defaults normative in skills","parent":"LNGHZN-S10","type":"task","scope":["docs/agents/workflow.md","internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md","internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-reviewer/SKILL.md","internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-worker/SKILL.md"],"acceptance":["make validate-skills green","make check green at task head","Coordinator skill states the remediation cap of 3 and hard-scoped confirmation review","Worker skill forbids full make check on intermediate remediations and requires it once at final task head"],"definition_of_done":"Skill and workflow text makes normative: fast gate for iteration and full gate at exactly the final task head and story integration (D1); one comprehensive review, parallel perspectives aggregated, one consolidated remediation, hard-scoped confirmation with critical-severity escape, cap of 3 cycles then human escalation (D5); medium effort default with planning-time high assignment and auto-escalation at remediation cycle 2, transcript-free dispatch, evidence-based gate acceptance rule (D6, D4 acceptance text).","context_files":["docs/design/gate-efficiency.md"],"priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
["create","LNGHZN-S10-T2",1786748962,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Add make check-fast with diff routing; single-run test/coverage in full gate","parent":"LNGHZN-S10","type":"task","scope":["Makefile","scripts/check-fast.sh (new)","scripts/test-check-fast.sh (new)","docs/agents/quality-gates.md"],"acceptance":["scripts/test-check-fast.sh passes: doc-only diff runs no mutate, coverage, or crosscompile","scripts/test-check-fast.sh passes: cmd flag diff routes census-drift-check plus cmd package tests","make check runs the unit suite exactly once (coverage read from the same run)","make check green at task head"],"definition_of_done":"make check-fast routes deterministically from git diff against merge-base HEAD origin/main (BASE= override): Go changes run lint+build+tests for changed packages plus reverse importers; skills/docs-skills changes run skill/doc validation; cmd or census-surface changes run census-drift-check; docs-only changes run adr-principles only. The full gate runs the unit suite once with -coverprofile and the coverage threshold reads that profile instead of re-running tests.","context_files":["docs/design/gate-efficiency.md"],"priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
["create","LNGHZN-S10-T3",1786748962,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Gate evidence: config-declared profiles, arm gate run, evidence ops in review bundle","parent":"LNGHZN-S10","type":"task","scope":["internal/config/config.go","internal/config/config_test.go","internal/ops/gate_evidence.go (new)","internal/ops/gate_evidence_test.go (new)","cmd/armature/gate.go (new)","cmd/armature/gate_test.go (new)","internal/review/bundle_evidence.go (new)","internal/review/bundle_evidence_test.go (new)","docs/commands.md","docs/design/surface-census.md"],"acceptance":["TestGateRunRecordsEvidence_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T3 passes","TestGateRunDirtyTreeUncitable_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T3 passes","TestGateRunUnconfiguredRepoErrors_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T3 passes","TestReviewBundleIncludesGateEvidence_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T3 passes","make check green at task head (census includes arm gate)"],"definition_of_done":"Config gains a gates map ({name: {command: []string}}) with profile name 'full' reserved as the publish profile. arm gate run \u003cprofile\u003e executes the configured command, streams output to a log file, and appends an evidence op (profile, command, head SHA, start, end, exit) to the invoking worker's own log; a dirty tree records the run as uncommitted/uncitable; unconfigured repos get a clear error. ReviewBundle includes gate evidence ops so reviewers can cite them.","context_files":["docs/design/gate-efficiency.md","docs/adr/0014-two-tier-gates-and-evidence-based-acceptance.md"],"priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
["create","LNGHZN-S10-T4",1786748962,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Validate strict by default, warning burn-down, plan-release enforcement","parent":"LNGHZN-S10","type":"task","scope":["cmd/armature/validate.go","cmd/armature/validate_test.go","internal/validate/validate.go","internal/validate/validate_test.go","cmd/armature/dag_transition.go","cmd/armature/dag_transition_test.go","docs/commands.md","docs/design/surface-census.md"],"acceptance":["TestValidateStrictDefault_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T4 passes","TestDagTransitionRequiresValidateGreen_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T4 passes","arm validate exits 0 with silent output on this repo","make check green at task head"],"definition_of_done":"arm validate runs strict by default: warnings are errors, green output is silent (summary line only). All pre-existing warnings in this repo are fixed or their rules corrected — no waivers, no scoping. dag transition to released/verified states requires validate green, so findings die at plan release. Full gate includes arm validate --ci.","context_files":["docs/design/gate-efficiency.md"],"priority":"medium","confidence":"draft"}]
