["note","LNGHZN-S10-T1",1786750724,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"msg":"HITL decision (Brian Scully, 2026-08-14): review rating red ACCEPTED as a known bootstrapping gap. Both not_satisfied criteria (acceptance[0], acceptance[1]) failed solely for absence of a gate-evidence op; the mechanism that emits one is LNGHZN-S10-T3, not yet implemented, so the failure is unremediable by construction. Text delivery verified correct and in-scope by the same review. Re-review T1 against real gate evidence after T3 lands. Finding logged: docs/dogfood/findings/raw/2026-08-14T2338Z-5207ee28-coordination-normative-rule-lands-before-its-evidence-mechanism.md","note_id":"note-1786750724635480879"}]
