["amend","LNGHZN-S10-T6",1786751156,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"acceptance":["TestGlobOverlapsIgnoresSharedAncestorDirectory_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T6: docs/agents/quality-gates.md vs docs/use-cases.md reports NO overlap, and internal/claim/overlap.go vs internal/claim/overlap_test.go reports NO overlap","TestGlobOverlapsStillMatchesIdenticalAndGlobScopes_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T6: README.md vs README.md reports overlap, and docs/agents/** vs docs/agents/quality-gates.md reports overlap","arm claim LNGHZN-S10-T2 succeeds without --force after the fix","make check is green"],"definition_of_done":"globOverlaps no longer reports overlap for two distinct files that merely share a containing or ancestor directory: the extractDir/hasPrefix fallback is removed from the blocking path and overlap is decided by path or glob match only. Explicit directory globs (docs/agents/**) still conflict correctly."}]
