["note","LNGHZN-S7-T1",1786751635,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"msg":"Bounded review closed at cycle 1 of 3 (D5). Initial rating yellow; one consolidated remediation issued covering both actionable findings (contracted test-name traceability gap; untested third precedence level). Hard-scoped confirmation at ab1b4fa4 verified: TestDefaultTTLGovernsClaim_REQ_LNGHZN_S7_T1 and TestTokenBudgetHonoredByRenderContext_REQ_LNGHZN_S7_T1 now exist verbatim, superseded names removed, TestClaimFallsBackToBuiltInTTLWhenConfigAbsent_REQ_LNGHZN_S7_T1 and TestRenderContextFallsBackToBuiltInBudgetWhenConfigAbsent_REQ_LNGHZN_S7_T1 added for the built-in-default level, remediation touched only cmd/armature/claim_test.go, make check STATUS_SUCCESS. Remaining indeterminate criterion (citable gate evidence) is the known LNGHZN-S10-T3 tooling gap, not a delivery defect.","note_id":"note-1786751635845984853"}]
["transition","LNGHZN-S10-T6",1786752234,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"to":"done","outcome":"Removed the directory-ancestry fallback from globOverlaps in internal/claim/overlap.go; overlap is now decided by filepath.Match plus scopematch.Allows (reusing the repo's canonical matcher) so distinct files sharing a containing or ancestor directory no longer collide, while explicit directory globs still match files beneath them. Added TestGlobOverlapsIgnoresSharedAncestorDirectory_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T6 and TestGlobOverlapsStillMatchesIdenticalAndGlobScopes_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T6; corrected three existing assertions that encoded the fallback bug, and fixed internal/ready/waves_test.go where the same bug had been forcing sibling-file tasks into separate waves. make check green at 2445f64b. Delivery gate skipped: CleanTree flagged only gitignored build outputs (bin/, coverage.out, mutesting-report/, scripts/__pycache__/) produced by the mandated make check run; tracked tree was clean per git status --short. Known issue, see docs/dogfood/findings/raw/2026-08-09T1510Z-claude-validation-delivery-gate-counts-ignored-artifacts.md","skipped_delivery_gate":true}]
