["amend","LNGHZN-S10-T8",1786752914,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"acceptance":["TestClaimIgnoresNonTaskIssuesInOverlapCheck_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T8: an in-progress story whose aggregate scope overlaps does not block claiming a task in another story","TestClaimStillBlocksOnOverlappingClaimedTask_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T8: a claimed or in-progress task with genuinely overlapping scope still blocks the claim","The overlap error message names the conflicting issue type and its holder","make check is green"]}]
["amend","LNGHZN-S10-T9",1786752914,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"definition_of_done":"Scope overlap detects a non-empty intersection between two glob patterns, not only glob-to-literal containment, so src/auth/*.go and src/auth/login.* are reported as overlapping. The reviewer and worker skills gain an explicit not-yet-enforceable state, distinct from indeterminate, so a rule whose mechanism has not shipped cannot force a red verdict or mandate a missing make target."}]
