["note","LNGHZN-S10-T9",1786753437,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"msg":"TITLE IS STALE: it still reads 'glob-vs-glob overlap, and normative rules that precede their mechanism' but the glob-vs-glob half was moved to LNGHZN-S10-T6 remediation on 2026-08-15. arm amend has no --title flag, so the title could not be corrected in place. T9's actual contract is the dod and acceptance fields: the not-yet-enforceable state in the reviewer and worker skills only. Scope is the two SKILL.md files.","note_id":"note-1786753437733605537"}]
["note","LNGHZN-S10-T9",1786753438,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"msg":"blocked_by LNGHZN-S10-T7 is now vestigial: it was set when T9 still owned the internal/claim glob work. T9's remaining scope (two SKILL.md files) does not depend on T7. A future coordinator may treat T9 as ready once T7 lands, or unlink if arm gains that capability.","note_id":"note-1786753438001981106"}]
