["note","LNGHZN-S10-T8",1786756293,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"msg":"First semantic review recorded Green (5/5 satisfied) on bundle sha256:bd2f2637 vs origin/main 376aa469..head 6d3bace6. Codex left 4 P1s on PR #103: (1) overlap scan skips bugs/features/claimed stories — out of T8 contract (DoD requires W1 task-only filter); (2-4) inherited T1 skill/docs commits on this PR (check-fast missing, gate-evidence rule before evidence ops, reviewer vs coordinator JSON protocol). Human merge: T8 fix itself is ready; decide whether to land the extra T1 skill docs onto main with this PR.","note_id":"note-1786756293733090559"}]
["create","LNGHZN-S10-T10",1786761568,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Close T1 confirmation-protocol holes: cycle loop, claim slot, parallel review paths","parent":"LNGHZN-S10","type":"task","scope":["internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-coordinator/SKILL.md","internal/skillsembed/skills/armature-reviewer/SKILL.md","docs/agents/workflow.md"],"acceptance":["Coordinator a.2 inspects the confirmation rating and repeats reopen/reclaim/remediate/confirm until green or cycle 3, then escalates; it does not proceed to a.3/merge on a non-green confirmation","Coordinator remediating arm claim sets ARM_LOG_SLOT (or claims as the remediator worker id) so applyHeartbeat ClaimedBy matches","Parallel reviewers write distinct .armature/review/ paths for the same issue; coordinator consolidates to one findings list before arm review record","make validate-skills is green"],"definition_of_done":"Coordinator a.2 executable steps match T1's 3-cycle cap: non-green confirmation repeats reopen/reclaim/remediate/confirm and never falls through to overlap-audit/merge. Remediation arm claim uses the same identity the remediator heartbeats under (ARM_LOG_SLOT / ClaimedBy). Parallel reviewers write distinct .armature/review/ paths; coordinator consolidates to one findings list before arm review record.","priority":"high","confidence":"verified"}]
["note","LNGHZN-S10-T10",1786761582,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"msg":"Filed 2026-08-15 so PR #103 can merge without sneaking more T1 skill work onto T8. Captures three leftover holes in merged T1 (PR #100 / 38a7da49), surfaced by Codex on #103 after rebase: (1) 3788214664 P1 — executable a.2 steps 5-6 are a single remediation/confirmation pass; 3-cycle cap is only in the normative list; non-green confirmation falls through to a.3/merge. (2) 3788214667 P2 — coordinator remediating arm claim is unslotted; remediator exports ARM_LOG_SLOT; applyHeartbeat requires exact ClaimedBy match so remediating heartbeats are ignored. (3) 3788130822 P1 — unique .armature/review/ path per parallel reviewer + consolidation; T1 only uniqued per bundle-id so confirmation does not clobber first pass. Same gap as #100 P2 3788148910, closed without a convention. Distinct from T9 (not-yet-enforceable check-fast / gate-evidence). Blocked by T9 because both touch armature-reviewer/SKILL.md.","note_id":"note-1786761582581220981"}]
["note","LNGHZN-S10-T8",1786761582,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"msg":"T1 protocol leftovers on PR #103 (3788214664 cycle loop, 3788214667 claim slot, 3788130822 parallel review paths) captured as LNGHZN-S10-T10. T8 contract unchanged (W1 task-only overlap in claim.go). Human can merge #103.","note_id":"note-1786761582787682213"}]
