["transition","LNGHZN-S10-T5",1787060737,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"to":"done","outcome":"Delivered D8 vertical-slice planning validation: plan release now fails when one task's scope touches a censused surface (cmd/**) while a different task in the same story owns the census/doc files that surface's drift check reads (docs/commands.md, docs/design/surface-census.md). The error names both tasks and the coupled files and states the co-location remedy. New internal/validate/coupling.go plugs into the strict plan-release path from T4; docs/design/gate-efficiency.md D8 section updated. Both acceptance tests pass (TestPlanCouplingDetection_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T5, TestPlanCouplingCoLocatedScopePasses_REQ_LNGHZN_S10_T5); arm gate run full exit=0 at task head (log .armature/gates/full-1787060228944098968.log) with mutation efficacy 100% on internal and cmd. Draft PR https://github.com/scullxbones/armature/pull/112 stacked on main. Closes the last open task of story LNGHZN-S10 (D1-D8 delivered).","branch":"task/LNGHZN-S10-T5","pr":"112"}]
