["decision","LNGHZN-S10-T5",1787499388,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"topic":"I7 override: accept missing conformance review","choice":"promote to merged","rationale":"Task LNGHZN-S10-T5 has no recorded conformance assessment (.armature/review/LNGHZN-S10-T5-*.json), violating the coordinator protocol (armature-coordinator SKILL.md line 360: non-green confirmation never enters a.3 or merge). However, conformance review did occur on GitHub: PR #112 underwent three review cycles (commits c13bdce1, 32e0d180, 7cc683dc) with substantive remediation, then merged on 2026-08-20 after final fix (80dee97c). Gate evidence is present: arm gate run full exit=0 at task head (.armature/gates/full-1787060228944098968.log). Per Constitution I7 (humans own outcomes; accountability never transfers to the system), the human accepts the GitHub review record as sufficient conformance evidence and authorizes promotion. Worktree: .worktrees/LNGHZN-S10-T5 (if present); task branch: task/LNGHZN-S10-T5 (merged to feat/LNGHZN-S10 and main).","affects":["cmd/**","docs/**"]}]
