["decision","LNGHZN-S10",1787510843,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"topic":"I7 override: explicit story close despite cancelled children and no worktree","choice":"force promotion","rationale":"After T5 is merged, S10 still will not roll up: RunRollup counts cancelled children (T9, task-1787058254) as unmerged. Closing requires arm transition --to done while on main (--force for the branch check) then arm merged --force because no story worktree/hook-log exists (done issues fail closed without one). This is not arm transition --to merged (the ARCHIMP-S15 hole). D1-D8 of docs/design/gate-efficiency.md are on main; 10 tasks merged; two cancelled as redundant; full gate green at 80dee97c; arm validate clean. Human accepts the stacked --force under I7. doctor D8 environment noise is accepted and is not part of this override."}]
