["create","AOC-S3-T2",1787543046,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Price dynamic structured payloads in context-report","parent":"AOC-S3","type":"task","scope":["internal/contextreport/dynamic.go (new)","internal/contextreport/dynamic_test.go (new)","internal/contextreport/testdata/ (new)","docs/context-budgets.md"],"acceptance":["TestContextReportPricesDynamicPayloads_REQ_AOC_S3_T2 passes","TestDynamicPricingIsFixtureDeterministic_REQ_AOC_S3_T2 passes","make context-report lists structured payloads","make check green"],"definition_of_done":"internal/contextreport prices structured command payloads using the same bytes/4 convention as static artifacts, measured against a checked-in fixture graph so the number is reproducible. Dynamic payloads join the existing budgets file and shrink-only ratchet, with initial values seeded at or above current measured size so the gate starts green. NXTTN-S3 and NXTTN-S3-T1 have their dynamic-artifacts-out-of-scope clause removed.","context_files":["docs/design/agent-output-contract.md"],"priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
