["create","AOC-S3-T3",1787543046,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"title":"Shape lint enumerated from the cobra command tree","parent":"AOC-S3","type":"task","scope":["internal/output/conformance.go (new)","internal/output/conformance_test.go (new)","internal/output/testdata/golden/ (new)"],"acceptance":["TestEveryAgentFacingCommandHasConformingFixture_REQ_AOC_S3_T3 passes","TestNewCommandWithoutFixtureFailsLint_REQ_AOC_S3_T3 passes","TestProtocolOutputExemptedByClassificationNotName_REQ_AOC_S3_T3 passes","make check green"],"definition_of_done":"A lint walks every registered cobra command and asserts that each agent-facing command has a golden fixture conforming to the contract. A command with no fixture fails the lint rather than being skipped, so adding a command without a fixture fails make check. Protocol Output commands are exempted only via their explicit classification, never by name.","context_files":["docs/design/agent-output-contract.md"],"priority":"high","confidence":"draft"}]
