["amend","LNGHZN-S6-T1",1787543327,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"definition_of_done":"internal/errors gains a StructuredError type: domain-prefixed code (per-package const block), one-line cause, exitcodes.Code, next_actions (resolved commands, \u003cplaceholder\u003e only where arm cannot supply a value). Codes register at construction, panic on duplicate. Human: Error [CODE]: cause plus Try: lines. Structured: {error:{code,cause,next_actions,exit_code}} nested in the Agent Output Contract envelope on stdout, replacing jsonErrorPayload and the duplicate cobra Error: line."}]
