["amend","AOC-S2-T4",1787833011,"5207ee28-cdd8-48e6-98dc-7da179d4a40d",{"scope":["cmd/armature/context_history.go","cmd/armature/context_history_test.go","cmd/armature/workers.go","cmd/armature/workers_test.go","cmd/armature/validate.go","cmd/armature/worktree.go","docs/commands.md"],"acceptance":["TestWorkersEmitsEnvelopeNotJSONL_REQ_AOC_S2_T4 passes","TestContextHistoryScansFullHistoryByDefault_REQ_AOC_S2_T4 passes","TestContextHistoryExplicitLimitIsDisclosed_REQ_AOC_S2_T4 passes","TestAllAgentFacingCommandsEmitEnvelope_REQ_AOC_S2_T4 passes","TestHarnessHookOutputUnchanged_REQ_AOC_S2_T4 passes","make check green"],"definition_of_done":"Every remaining agent-facing command in this batch emits the envelope: workers, validate, worktree and context-history. Each payload key is named. context-history scans complete history by default; explicit --limit defines a disclosed boundary and count equals returned rows within it. harness-hook remains Protocol Output."}]
